      "@type": "SemioticProjection",
      "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
      "label": "User projected onto the textual material and visual material of the meme",
      "description": "The user is projected onto the textual material 'at the isis strip club' and the visual material of the sheep in the middle panel, as the meme uses these elements to create a satirical and derogatory stereotype about ISIS followers. The user is implicitly identifying with the viewer of the meme, interpreting the visual and textual elements as a commentary on group conformity and extremism.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
